OL,3,CFleadh Cheoil na hEireann 2026 kicks
OL,4,Coff with musical celebration in Belfast
OL,6,FThe largest festival of Irish music
OL,7,Fand culture in the world has kicked
OL,8,Foff in Belfast for the first time.
OL,10,FThe Fleadh Cheoil na hEireann official
OL,11,Fopening ceremony takes place from
OL,12,Fmidday on Sunday.
OL,14,FThe festival is expecting to host
OL,15,Faround 800,000 people through eight
OL,16,Fdays from Sunday, 2nd August to
OL,17,FMonday, 10th August.
OL,26,@kD@SrbrD@Wrb
