OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1785772100
OL,3,CFleadh Cheoil na hEireann 2026 kicks
OL,4,Coff with musical celebration in Belfast
OL,6,FMore than 200 events and 180
OL,7,Ftraditional music competitions are
OL,8,Ftaking place across venues, pubs, and
OL,9,Fstreets throughout the celebration.
OL,11,FIt is the first time the annual music
OL,12,Ffestival has been held in Belfast and
OL,13,Fonly the second time it has been held
OL,14,Fin Northern Ireland, after being
OL,15,Fhosted in Londonderry in 2013.
OL,26,@kD@Srb
