PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1785772100
OL,3,CFleadh Cheoil na hEireann 2026 kicks
OL,4,Coff with musical celebration in Belfast
OL,6,FThe 2026 event is set to be one of the
OL,7,Fmost culturally diverse in its
OL,8,Fhistory, with cross-community
OL,9,Fparticipation and a celebration of
OL,10,Ftraditions from across Northern
OL,11,FIreland and beyond.
OL,13,FPublic transport is the recommended
OL,14,Fway to arrive as no parking or waiting
OL,15,Frestrictions as well as the creation
OL,16,Fof a large pedestrianised zone will
OL,17,Fmake driving through the city centre
OL,18,Fdifficult.
OL,26,@kD@Srb
