OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1785772100
OL,3,CFleadh Cheoil na hEireann 2026 kicks
OL,4,Coff with musical celebration in Belfast
OL,6,FThe opening event at Fleadh 2026 will
OL,7,Finclude a special collaborative
OL,8,Fperformance from host branch, Ards
OL,9,FCCE, South Asian Dance Academy,
OL,10,FBelfast Bands Forum, as well as an
OL,11,Farray of highland pipers and champion
OL,12,FIrish dancers led by Riverdance lead,
OL,13,FLauren Smyth.
OL,15,FThey will play at the Gig Rig set up
OL,16,Foutside City Hall, where musicians and
OL,17,Fdancers will play from 11am to 11pm
OL,18,Fevery day of the week.
OL,26,@kD@SrbqD@Crb
