CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1785772100
OL,3,CFleadh Cheoil na hEireann 2026 kicks
OL,4,Coff with musical celebration in Belfast
OL,6,FOn Sunday the outdoor stage will also
OL,7,Fwelcome over 100 children from primary
OL,8,Fand secondary schools across North
OL,9,FDown and Belfast as part of a schools
OL,10,Fchoir project, continuing to the
OL,11,Fevening with Goitse, Blackwater Ceili
OL,12,FBand and accordion virtuoso Sharon
OL,13,FShannon and her Big Band.
OL,15,FMusicians and dancers from across the
OL,16,Fworld flock to the host city with the
OL,17,Faim to compete in the All-Ireland
OL,18,FFleadh music competition with hopefuls
OL,19,Ffrom Ireland qualifying from county
OL,20,Fand provincial Fleadhs to earn their
OL,21,Fplace.
OL,26,@kD@SrbsD@brrsD@ert
